# 31. RISKS & MITIGATION

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Data Loss | Critical | Auto Save, Versioning, Backup |
| Workspace Leakage | Critical | Strict Tenant Isolation |
| AI Prompt Injection | High | Tool Permissions, Untrusted Context |
| API Key Exposure | Critical | Encryption, Secrets |
| Large Workspace | High | Pagination, Lazy Loading |
| Concurrent Editing | High | Version Checks, Conflict Handling |
| Broken Internal Links | High | Stable File IDs |
| R2 Storage Cost | Medium | Storage Monitoring |
| AI API Cost | Medium | Usage Tracking, Context Limits |
| Mobile UX Complexity | Medium | Mobile-first Testing |

